=Terraformer=
{{img:units/Terraformer.png}}
* Cost: {{img:Minerals.png}}40
* [[concepts/initiative|Initiative]]: 100
* [[concepts/weight|Weight]]: 2
* [[concepts/sensory|Base scanning range]]: 4
* Construction: Converts {{img:Minerals.png}}10 per round
* Terraforming: Can shape the surrounding terrain
This turret type can build structures in valid locations. It requires {{img:Minerals.png}} to initiate construction.
